/*
 * Bailey date system.
 * "Spend time with Bailey" menu only appears when Stockholm >= 1 and rent is current ($rentTime > 0).
 */

:: Bailey Date Menu
<<effects>><<speechresolve>>
<<endevent>><<npc Bailey>><<person1>>
/* Bailey prices his time against what rent tops out at, so the tiers stay
proportional when a player scales rent up or down. */
<<set _spankPrice to baileyPrice("spank")>>
<<set _shortPrice to baileyPrice("short")>>
<<set _mediumPrice to baileyPrice("medium")>>
<<set _allNightPrice to baileyPrice("allNight")>>

<<if $rentTime lte 0>> /* should be inaccessible */
	<<He>> looks at you like you've lost your mind.
	<br><br>
	"You want to pay for my time?" <<He>> leans back in <<his>> chair. "Pay what you owe first."
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Back|Orphanage]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
		"I-I would like to spend time with you," you say to <<him>>, fidgeting in place. "I-I can pay."
	<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
		"I'd like to arrange some time with you," you say. "I'll pay whatever you usually charge."
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
		You place your money on the desk. "I'd like to spend some time with you, if you'll allow it."
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
		"I want some of your time," you say. "Tell me what it costs."
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty">>
		"Spend time with me," you demand. "I'll pay for it."
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel">>
		"Your time has a price like everything else here," you say. "Name it."
	<<else>>
		"If I pay, will you spend time with me?" you ask.
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<if $baileyDateShort gte 3>>
		Bailey writes in a ledger. <<He>> doesn't look surprised. "Pay up."
	<<elseif $baileyDateShort gte 1>>
		Bailey writes in a ledger. After a long moment, <<he>> sets down <<his>> pen and looks at you. "Again? Didn't you waste enough money the first time?"
	<<else>>
		Bailey writes in a ledger. After a long moment, <<he>> sets down <<his>> pen and looks at you.
		<br><br>
		"You're actually serious," <<he>> scoffs.
	<</if>>
	<br><br>

	/* Food Gift */
	<<if $syndromeBaileyBuild gt 1 and C.npc.Bailey and canGiftFood("Bailey")>>
		<<skinicon "give">><<link [[Bring Bailey a meal|Bailey Gifts List]]>><</link>>
		<br>
		<br>
	<</if>>

	/* Strap-on Gift */
	<<if C.npc.Bailey.sextoys>>
		<<for _key range Object.keys(C.npc.Bailey.sextoys).filter(t => C.npc.Bailey.sextoys[t][0].gift_state === "held" && checkIfNPCHasCategorySextoy("Bailey","strap-on").length <= 5)>>
			<<set _toy to C.npc.Bailey.sextoys[_key][0]>>
			<<set _icon to `sex-toys/${_toy.name.replace(/ /g, "-")}.png`>>
			<span @class="`clothes-${_toy.colour}`"><<icon _icon>></span>
			<<capture _toy>>
				<<link [[Gift Bailey the _toy.colour _toy.name|Bailey Gift Strap-on]]>><<set $baileyGiftToy to _toy.name>><</link>>
			<</capture>>
			<br>
		<</for>>
	<</if>>

	/* Spanking*/
	<<if $daily.baileySpankingProper>>
		<span class="blue">"I have <<printprice _spankPrice>>. Spank me properly." (You've already asked today.)</span>
		<br>
	<<elseif setup.inflation.canAfford(_spankPrice, "baileySpank")>>
		<<link [["I have <<printprice _spankPrice>>. Spank me properly." (0:10)|Bailey Spanking Proper Entry]]>><</link>>
		<br>
	<<else>>
		<span class="blue">"I have <<printprice _spankPrice>>. Spank me properly." (You don't have enough money.)</span>
		<br>
	<</if>>

	/* Short Date */
	<<if $daily.baileyDate>>
		<span class="blue">"I have <<printprice _shortPrice>>. Take me with you." (You've already spent time with Bailey today.)</span>
		<br>
	<<elseif setup.inflation.canAfford(_shortPrice, "baileyDate")>>
		<<link [["I have <<printprice _shortPrice>>. Take me with you." (1:00)|Bailey Date Short]]>><<money `-_shortPrice` "baileyDate">><<pass 5>><<set $daily.baileyDate to 1>><</link>>
		<br>
	<<else>>
		<span class="blue">"I have <<printprice _shortPrice>>. Take me with you." (You don't have enough money.)</span>
		<br>
	<</if>>

	/* Medium Date, requires short date done */
	<<if $baileyDateShort gte 1>>
		<<if $baileyDateScheduled>>
			<span class="blue">"I have <<printprice _mediumPrice>>. Let me buy you dinner." (You already have a date scheduled tonight.)</span>
			<br>
		<<elseif $daily.baileyDate>>
			<span class="blue">"I have <<printprice _mediumPrice>>. Let me buy you dinner." (You've already spent time with Bailey today.)</span>
			<br>
		<<elseif Time.hour gte 19>>
			<span class="blue">"I have <<printprice _mediumPrice>>. Let me buy you dinner." (It's too late to book dinner tonight. Ask in the morning.)</span>
			<br>
		<<elseif setup.inflation.canAfford(_mediumPrice, "baileyDate")>>
			<<link [["I have <<printprice _mediumPrice>>. Let me buy you dinner." (0:05)|Bailey Date Medium Schedule]]>><<pass 5>><<money `-_mediumPrice` "baileyDate">><<set $daily.baileyDate to 1>><</link>>
			<br>
		<<else>>
			<span class="blue">"I have <<printprice _mediumPrice>>. Let me buy you dinner." (You don't have enough money.)</span>
			<br>
		<</if>>
	<</if>>

	/* All Night Date, requires Medium date done */
	<<if $baileyDateMedium gte 1>>
		<<if $baileyDateAllNightScheduled>>
			<span class="blue">"I have <<printprice _allNightPrice>>. I want to spend the night." (You already have a date scheduled tonight.)</span>
			<br>
		<<elseif $daily.baileyDate>>
			<span class="blue">"I have <<printprice _allNightPrice>>. I want to spend the night." (You've already spent time with Bailey today.)</span>
			<br>
		<<elseif Time.hour gte 19>>
			<span class="blue">"I have <<printprice _allNightPrice>>. I want to spend the night." (It's too late to schedule tonight. Ask in the morning.)</span>
			<br>
		<<elseif setup.inflation.canAfford(_allNightPrice, "baileyDate")>>
			<<link [["I have <<printprice _allNightPrice>>. I want to spend the night." (0:15)|Bailey Date All Night Schedule]]>><<pass 15>><<money `-_allNightPrice` "baileyDate">><<set $daily.baileyDate to 1>><</link>>
			<br>
		<<else>>
			<span class="blue">"I have <<printprice _allNightPrice>>. I want to spend the night." (You don't have enough money.)</span>
			<br>
		<</if>>
	<</if>>

	/* Cat Ears */
	<br>
	<<set _catprice to baileyPrice("catEars") + 500>>
	<<if setup.inflation.canAfford(_catprice, "catEars")>>
		<<if !$baileyCatEars>>
			<<link [["I'll pay you <<printprice _catprice>> to put on cat ears." (0:05)|Bailey Cat Ears]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
		<<else>>
			<<link [["I'll pay you <<printprice _catprice>> to put on cat ears again." (0:05)|Bailey Cat Ears]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
		<</if>>
		<br>
	<<else>>
		<<if !$baileyCatEars>>
			<span class="blue">"I'll pay you <<printprice _catprice>> to put on cat ears." (You don't have enough money.)</span>
		<<else>>
			<span class="blue">"I'll pay you <<printprice _catprice>> to put on cat ears again." (You don't have enough money.)</span>
		<</if>>
		<br>
	<</if>>

	/* Change what you call Bailey */
	<<if $syndromeBailey>>
		<br>
		<<socialiseicon>><<link [[Change what you call <<him>>|Bailey Title Choose]]>><<set $baileyTitleFrom to "date_menu">><</link>>
		<br>
	<</if>>

	<br>
	<<link [[Back|Orphanage]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>


/* Short date: 50% of Bailey's max rent. */

:: Bailey Date Short
<<pass 10>><<effects>>
<<endevent>><<npc Bailey>><<person1>>
<<set $baileyDateShort += 1>>

You hold the money out to <<him>>.
<br><br>

Bailey takes the money and counts it before folding it into <<his>> jacket pocket.
<br><br>

"Come on, then," <<he>> says. "I have work to do."
<br><br>

<<if C.npc.Bailey.dom gte 70>>
	<<He>> walks fast, but you manage to keep up with <<his>> pace.
<<elseif C.npc.Bailey.dom gte 30>>
	<<He>> walks several strides ahead without looking back at you. You do your best to keep up.
<<else>>
	<<He>> walks fast and doesn't look back. You stumble behind <<him>> to catch up.
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Bailey Date Short Arrive]]>><</link>>
<br>


:: Bailey Date Short Arrive
<<effects>>
<<person1>>
<<set $baileyDateShortStole to false>><<set $baileyDateShortLeaned to false>><<set $baileyDateShortListened to false>><<set $baileyDateShortIntimidated to false>>

Bailey takes you to a sketchy, unmarked building on the west side of town. <<He>> tries the door and it opens.
<br><br>

<<generateNPC 2 a>><<person2>>A <<person>> is waiting inside. <<He>> looks up at Bailey, then over at you.
<br><br>

"Who's this?" <<he>> asks.
<br><br>

<<person1>>
<<if $syndromeBailey>>
	"Mine," Bailey says.
<<else>>
	"One of mine," Bailey says.
<</if>>
<br><br>

You look around. This appears to be an interrogation room of sorts. <<He>> sits down across from <<person2>>the <<personsimple>>. There are only two chairs around the table.
<br><br>

<<link [[Stand next to Bailey|Bailey Date Short Arrive Stand]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Kneel next to Bailey|Bailey Date Short Arrive Kneel]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Watch from across the room|Bailey Date Short Arrive Watch]]>><</link>>
<br>


:: Bailey Date Short Arrive Stand
<<effects>><<speechresolve>>
<<person1>>
<<set $phase to "stand">>

<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
	You quietly walk over and stand at Bailey's side. You shuffle in place, hoping you aren't doing anything wrong.
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
	You smooth your clothes as you cross the room, then take your place beside Bailey.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	You move to Bailey's side as soon as <<he>> signals, then wait with your hands held still in front of you.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
	You take your place beside Bailey, planting your feet before you look over the room.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty">>
	You cross your arms and take your place beside Bailey. When someone glances your way, you raise your chin until they turn back.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel">>
	You step up beside Bailey and stare across the room until the nearest onlooker looks away.
<<else>>
	You cross the room to stand at Bailey's side. Your eyes scan around the room.
<</if>>
<br><br>

Bailey doesn't look at you.
<br><br>

<<person2>>The <<personsimple>> sitting across from Bailey blabbers on. Something about payments.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Bailey Date Short Meeting]]>><</link>>
<br>


:: Bailey Date Short Arrive Kneel
<<effects>>
<<person1>>
<<set $phase to "kneel">>

You cross the room before kneeling next to Bailey's legs.
<br><br>

<<if $syndromeBailey>>
	<<He>> doesn't look at you, but <<his>> hand comes to rest on top of your head.<<npcincr Bailey lust 1>><<glust "Bailey">>
<<else>>
	Bailey glances down at you once before returning to <<his>> conversation.<<npcincr Bailey lust 1>><<glust "Bailey">>
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<person2>>The <<personsimple>> sitting across from Bailey blabbers on. Something about payments.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Bailey Date Short Meeting]]>><</link>>
<br>


:: Bailey Date Short Arrive Watch
<<effects>>
<<person1>>
<<set $phase to "watch">>

You listen to Bailey and <<person2>>the <<personsimple>> chat from across the room.
<br><br>

<<person2>>The <<personsimple>> seems nervous. <<person1>>Bailey is as unshakeable as ever.
<br><br>

They speak too vaguely for you to understand exactly what they were talking about. You make out something about "payments."
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Bailey Date Short Men]]>><</link>>
<br>


:: Bailey Date Short Meeting
<<effects>>
<<person1>>

<<person2>>The <<personsimple>> puts a folder on the table. The meeting starts.
<br><br>

<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 500>><<link [[Look for something to steal|Bailey Date Short Steal]]>><<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 500>><</link>><<skulduggerydifficulty>>
<br>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 300>><<link [[Listen to the meeting|Bailey Date Short Listen]]>><<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 300>><</link>><<skulduggerydifficulty>>
<br>
<<link [[Lean on the table|Bailey Date Short Lean]]>><</link>><<seductiondifficulty>>
<br>
<<link [[Intimidate|Bailey Date Short Intimidate]]>><</link>><<physiquedifficulty 200 600>>
<br>
<<link [[Stay quiet|Bailey Date Short Quiet]]>><</link>>
<br>


:: Bailey Date Short Steal
<<effects>>
<<person1>>
<<skulduggerycheck "silent">>

<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	<<if $phase is "kneel">>
		<<person2>>The <<personsimple>> sets a document on the table. Bailey's name is printed at the top. <span class="green">From where you are, you can reach the edge of it. You pull it off the table slowly and fold it against the floor.</span>
	<<else>>
		<<person2>>The <<personsimple>> sets a document on the table. Bailey's name is printed at the top. <span class="green">You slide it off the edge while <<person2>>the <<personsimple>> is looking at Bailey and fold it once against your palm.</span>
	<</if>>
	<br><br>

	<<person1>>Bailey notices. <<He>> says nothing.
	<br><br>

	<<set $baileyDateShortStole to true>>
<<else>>
	<<if $phase is "kneel">>
		<span class="red">Your hand brushes the paper loudly.</span> <<person2>>The <<personsimple>> looks down at you. <<He>> pulls the document away from the edge of the table.
	<<else>>
		<span class="red"><<person2>>The <<personsimple>>'s eyes drop to your hand.</span> <<person2>>The <<personsimple>> pulls the document back across the table without a word.
	<</if>>
	<br><br>

	Bailey glares at you.<<npcincr Bailey love -1>><<llove "Bailey">>
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Bailey Date Short Men]]>><</link>>
<br>


:: Bailey Date Short Listen
<<effects>><<speechresolve>>
<<person1>>
<<skulduggerycheck "silent">>

You listen to Bailey and <<person2>>the <<personsimple>> as they discuss business. They speak too vaguely for you to understand. At one point, Bailey looks over a paper that was handed to <<nnpc_him "Bailey">>. <<person2>>The <<personsimple>> seems anxious.
<br><br>

<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	<span class="green">You see <<person2>>the <<personsimple>> glance at the door behind <<him>> several times. Bailey didn't seem to notice.</span>
	<br><br>

	<<person1>>
	<<if $phase is "kneel">>
		You tug on Bailey's sleeve to get <<his>> attention. You hold a hand up to your mouth as you whisper to <<him>>.
	<<else>>
		You lean over Bailey's shoulder to whisper to <<him>>.
	<</if>>
	<br><br>

	<<set $pronoun to $NPCList[1].pronoun>>
	<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
		"T-The person you're working with... <<he>>'s waiting for someone," you whisper to Bailey, nervous but certain. "<<He>> keeps checking the door."
	<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
		"I think your associate expects company," you say close to Bailey's ear. "<<He>> keeps checking the door."
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
		"Someone else is coming," you say quietly. "I saw <<him>> check the door several times."
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
		"<<He>> has someone on the way," you tell Bailey. "Watch the door."
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty">>
		"The bastard has backup," you whisper to Bailey. "<<He>> keeps checking the door."
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel">>
		"Your associate brought backup," you tell Bailey. "Let them come."
	<<else>>
		"Someone else is coming," you whisper to Bailey. "<<He>> keeps checking the door."
	<</if>>
	<<person1>>
	<br><br>

	Bailey lifts <<his>> gaze from the paper to give you a sideways glance. <<He>> shifts <<his>> gaze to <<person2>>the <<personsimple>><<person1>>. Something in <<his>> eyes burns. "I see."
	<br><br>

	<<set $baileyDateShortListened to true>>
<<else>>
	You think you catch something in what <<person2>>the <<personsimple>> says. You open your mouth.
	<br><br>

	Before you can speak, <span class="red">Bailey's hand finds your arm</span>. "Quiet."<<npcincr Bailey love -1>><<llove "Bailey">>
	<br><br>

	<<person1>>Bailey keeps <<his>> eyes set on <<person2>>the <<personsimple>>.
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Bailey Date Short Men]]>><</link>>
<br>


:: Bailey Date Short Lean
<<effects>>
<<person1>>
<<set $seductiondifficulty to 6000>><<seductioncheck>>

<<if $phase is "kneel">>
	You crawl your way under the table towards <<person2>>the <<personsimple>>'s legs, pretending to pick up a pen that had fallen off the table.
<<else>>
	You lean over the table, pretending to take a better look at its contents.
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<if $seductionrating gte $seductionrequired>>
	<span class="green">"The boss won't like that..." <<person2>>The <<personsimple>> trails off mid-sentence, leering at you.</span>
	<br><br>

	After a beat of silence, Bailey speaks up. "Do we have a deal?"
	<br><br>

	<<person2>>The <<personsimple>> sputters, turning <<his>> gaze away from you back to Bailey. "Y-Yes. We do."
	<br><br>

	<<set $baileyDateShortLeaned to true>>
<<else>>
	<<person2>>The <<personsimple>> <span class="red">barely gives you a glance.</span>
	<br><br>

	Bailey whispers, only loud enough for you to hear. "Disgraceful."<<npcincr Bailey love -1>><<llove "Bailey">>
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Bailey Date Short Men]]>><</link>>
<br>


:: Bailey Date Short Intimidate
<<effects>>
<<person1>>

The conversation between Bailey and <<person2>>the <<personsimple>> seems to sour. <<person2>>The <<personsimple>> isn't backing down and Bailey sounds annoyed.
<br><br>

<<if $phase is "kneel">>
	You slowly stand to your full height from where you kneeled.
	<br><br>
<</if>>
You cross your arms and glower at <<person2>>the <<personsimple>>.
<br><br>

"Do we have a deal?" Bailey asks calmly.
<br><br>

<<if $physiqueSuccess is 1>>
	<span class="green"><<person2>>The <<personsimple>> sneaks a nervous glance towards you, <<his>> eyes focused on your crossed arms and hardened physique. <<He>> grunts out, "Fine."</span>
	<<set $baileyDateShortIntimidated to true>>
<<else>>
	<span class="red"><<person2>>The <<personsimple>> scoffs. "Tell your <<if $player.gender_appearance is "m">>boy<<else>>girl<</if>> to stand down."</span>
	<br><br>

	Bailey glares at you.<<npcincr Bailey love -1>><<llove "Bailey">>
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Bailey Date Short Men]]>><</link>>
<br>


:: Bailey Date Short Quiet
<<effects>>
<<person1>>

You watch quietly while Bailey and <<person2>>the <<personsimple>> conduct business.
<br><br>

They speak too vaguely for you to understand exactly what they were talking about.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Bailey Date Short Men]]>><</link>>
<br>


:: Bailey Date Short Men
<<effects>>
<<person1>>

<<person2>>The <<personsimple>> glances towards the door.
<br><br>

It opens. Two large figures step inside.
<br><br>

<<if $baileyDateShortListened>>
	Before they can take another step, two more figures enter behind them, placing hands on their shoulders. You recognize them to be Bailey's goons. They'd been outside waiting.
	<br><br>

	<<person2>>The <<personsimple>> glares at you.
	<br><br>
<<else>>
	The intruders position themselves by the door. The room seems to shrink.
	<br><br>

	Bailey doesn't look up from the table. After a long bout of tense silence, two more figures step inside through the door. You recognize them to be Bailey's goons.
	<br><br>
<</if>>

Bailey picks up the folder and stands. "We're done here."
<br><br>

<<person2>>The <<personsimple>> says nothing, glowering at you and Bailey both.
<br><br>

<<person1>>
<<if $syndromeBailey>>
	Bailey's hand finds your shoulder. <<He>> steers you out ahead of <<him>>.
<<else>>
	Bailey walks out. You follow.
<</if>>
<br><br>

Bailey's goons follow behind you.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Bailey Date Short Acknowledge]]>><</link>>
<br>


:: Bailey Date Short Acknowledge
<<effects>>
<<person1>>

Outside, Bailey nods to <<his>> goons, who disperse in separate directions.
<br><br>

<<if $baileyDateShortStole>>
	<<He>> turns to you and holds out a hand expectantly. You place the document you stole in <<his>> hand. <<He>> unfolds it and scans over it once before tucking it into the folder <<he>> carried.
	<br><br>

	"Good work."<<npcincr Bailey love 1>><<glove "Bailey">>
	<br><br>
<<elseif $baileyDateShortListened>>
	<<He>> watches <<his>> goons leave before turning to you. <<He>> seems pleased.
	<br><br>

	"Observant, aren't you?"<<npcincr Bailey love 1>><<glove "Bailey">>
	<br><br>
<<elseif $baileyDateShortLeaned>>
	<<He>> turns to you and looks over you, giving your full body a scan with <<his>> eyes.
	<br><br>

	"You know how to use your body. Good."<<npcincr Bailey love 1>><<glove "Bailey">>
	<br><br>
<<elseif $baileyDateShortIntimidated>>
	<<He>> turns to you and reaches over for your arm. Instead of pulling you, like <<he>> usually does, <<he>> squeezes it, as if testing for strength.
	<br><br>

	"Good. Keep getting stronger."<<npcincr Bailey love 1>><<glove "Bailey">>
	<br><br>
<<else>>
	<<He>> starts walking towards the orphanage. You follow <<him>>.
	<br><br>
<</if>>

<<link [[Next|Bailey Date Short Walk Back]]>><</link>>
<br>


:: Bailey Date Short Walk Back
<<pass 10>><<effects>>
<<person1>>

The walk back to the orphanage is uneventful, for the most part. Bailey walks without looking at you.
<br><br>

<<if $syndromeBaileyBuild gte 1>>
	<<His>> hand finds the small of your back. 
	<<rng>>
	<<if $rng lt 25>>
		<<He>> steers you around something in the pavement. <<His>> hand feels warm against your back.<<arousal 200>><<garousal>>
	<<elseif $rng lt 50>>
		<<His>> thumb moves once against your spine, as if testing your posture.<<arousal 200>><<garousal>><<npcincr Bailey lust 1>>
	<<elseif $rng lt 75>>
		Someone passes nearby. <<His>> hand leaves your back. When they're gone it returns.<<arousal 200>><<garousal>>
	<<else>>
		You do your best to keep pace.
	<</if>>
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Bailey Date Short End]]>><</link>>
<br>


:: Bailey Date Short End
<<pass 35>><<effects>>
<<person1>>

<<He>> stops at the orphanage door.
<br><br>

"Hope it was worth your money," <<he>> says with a shrug.
<br><br>

<<He>> leads you inside.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Orphanage]]>><<endevent>><<unset $baileyDateShortIntimidated, $baileyDateShortLeaned, $baileyDateShortListened, $baileyDateShortStole>><</link>>
<br>


/* Medium date: 100% of Bailey's max rent. */

:: Bailey Date Medium Schedule
<<effects>><<speechresolve>>
<<endevent>><<npc Bailey>><<person1>>
<<set $baileyDateScheduled to true>><<set $baileyDateSchedDay to Time.days>>

<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
	"I-I have <<printprice `baileyPrice("medium")`>> for you, if you take me out to dinner," you say. "I-I'll pay for everything."
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
