:: Bailey Date All Night Schedule
<<effects>><<speechresolve>>
<<endevent>><<npc Bailey>><<person1>>
<<set $baileyDateAllNightScheduled to true>><<set $baileyDateSchedDay to Time.days>>

<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
	"I-I have <<printprice `baileyPrice("allNight")`>>," you say. Your hands shake as you hold it out. "I want to stay the night with you."
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
	"I'd like the whole evening with you," you say, presenting <<printprice `baileyPrice("allNight")`>>. "That includes staying the night."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	You offer Bailey <<printprice `baileyPrice("allNight")`>> without pulling your hand back. "May I stay with you tonight?"
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
	You set <<printprice `baileyPrice("allNight")`>> on the desk. "This buys the entire night. I'll be staying with you."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty">>
	"<<printprice `baileyPrice("allNight")`>>." You set the thick stack of money on <<his>> desk. "I'm staying the night."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel">>
	You press <<printprice `baileyPrice("allNight")`>> against Bailey's ledger. "Clear your plans. I bought the night."
<<else>>
	"I have <<printprice `baileyPrice("allNight")`>>," you say, holding the money out. "I want to stay the night."
<</if>>
<br><br>

Bailey takes your money and pockets it.
<br><br>

<<He>> looks at you for a long time after, hand pressed over <<his>> jacket pocket.
<br><br>

"<span class="green">7PM.</span>" <<He>> turns back to <<his>> desk. "Don't be late."
