<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
	"Good morning, <<baileyTitleNarration>>," you say as you enter. "I hope the couch didn't keep you awake."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	You stop near the doorway. "Good morning, <<baileyTitleNarration>>. Did you sleep well?"
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
	"Morning, <<baileyTitleNarration>>," you say as you join <<him>>. "You're up early."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty">>
	"Morning <<baileyTitleNarration>>," you say. "Do you even sleep?"
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel">>
	"You look as tired as you did last night," you say. "Do you ever sleep?"
<<else>>
	"Good morning <<baileyTitleNarration>>," you say. "You're up early."
<</if>>
<br><br>

Bailey says nothing back to you. <<He>> continues to drink from <<his>> coffee.
<br><br>

"Make yourself presentable," Bailey says. "I'll drive you to the orphanage."
<br><br>

<<link [[Go with Bailey|Bailey Date All Night End]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Insist you can walk|Bailey Date All Night Morning Insist]]>><</link>>
