:: Bailey Date All Night Stay Quiet
<<pass 5>><<effects>><<endevent>><<speechresolve>>
<<npc Bailey>><<person1>>

<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
	You take a seat without speaking and keep your hands together in your lap.
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
	You give Bailey a small nod before taking a seat, leaving the morning quiet undisturbed.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	You sit where Bailey left space for you and wait without asking for anything.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
	You pull out a chair and settle into it, waiting for Bailey to speak first.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty">>
	You drop into a chair and fold your arms. When Bailey remains silent, you do the same.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel">>
	You take the chair opposite Bailey and stare at <<him>> until <<he>> looks away.
<<else>>
	You sit across from Bailey without saying anything.
<</if>>
<br><br>

You watch Bailey drink coffee from <<his>> mug slowly. <<He>> looks out the window into the town with a slight frown. You can barely tell <<he>> just woke up.
<br><br>

After a moment, <<he>> looks at you.
<br><br>

"Make yourself presentable," Bailey says. "I'll drive you to the orphanage."
<br><br>

<<link [[Go with Bailey|Bailey Date All Night End]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Insist you can walk|Bailey Date All Night Morning Insist]]>><</link>>
<br>


:: Bailey Date All Night Morning Insist
<<pass 5>><<effects>><<endevent>><<speechresolve>>
<<npc Bailey>><<person1>>

<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
	"I-I can walk myself," you say. "You don't have to drive me."
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
	"Thank you, but I can make my own way back," you say. "There's no need to drive me."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	You stop beside the door. "I can walk back, if that's easier for you."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
	"I'll walk," you say as you reach for the door. "I know the way."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty">>
	"I don't need you to drive me," you say. "I'll walk myself."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel">>
	You open the door without waiting. "Keep the car. I've spent enough time with you."
<<else>>
	"I can walk there myself," you say.
<</if>>
<br><br>

"You're coming with me," Bailey replies bluntly. "You can walk from the orphanage."
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Bailey Date All Night End]]>><</link>>
<br>


:: Bailey Date All Night End
<<set $bus to "barb">><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<endevent>>
<<npc Bailey>><<person1>><<pass 5>>

The two of you exit Bailey's flat. <<He>> locks the door behind <<him>> before leading you down the stairs into the underground car park. <<He>> taps <<his>> jacket and <<his>> car lights up.
<br><br>

The two of you enter <<his>> vehicle.
<br><br>

There are very few cars on the road this early in the morning. Bailey hasn't looked at you since you left <<his>> flat.
<br><br>

The drive back is short and uneventful.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Bailey Date All Night End 2]]>><</link>>
<br>


:: Bailey Date All Night End 2
<<pass 15>><<set $location to "home">><<set $outside to 0>><<effects>><<endevent>>
<<npc Bailey>><<person1>>
<<baileySeenAdd "flatUnlock">>
<<set $baileyDateAllNightScheduled to false>>
<<set $baileyDateAttended to false>>

Bailey parks <<his>> car outside the orphanage.
<br><br>

You both exit the car. <<He>> walks into the orphanage first. You follow a few steps behind <<him>>.
<br><br>

<<He>> glances at you once before turning towards <<his>> office.
<br><br>

You can hear orphans throughout the building getting ready for their day.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Orphanage]]>><<endevent>><<unset $baileyCoffee, $baileySleepConfig, $baileyWeekendRound>><</link>>
